stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> FRESH: Nominal SCD30 Frame Received (CRC-8 OK)

    FRESH --> STALE: Latency tau > 2.5 s
    STALE --> FRESH: Latency tau <= 2.5 s

    FRESH --> DEGRADED: SCD30 Rate-of-Change Spike / I2C CRC Retry
    DEGRADED --> FRESH: Nominal SCD30 Stability Restored

    FRESH --> FAULT: SCD30 Null / Out of Bounds / Stall / tau > 10 s
    STALE --> FAULT: Latency tau > 10.0 s
    DEGRADED --> FAULT: Complete Dropout or Blower Stall
    FAULT --> FRESH: Valid Nominal SCD30 Frame Restored
